<title>FRANCE: Havas shareholders approve Generale deal.</title>
<headline>Havas shareholders approve Generale deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>An extraordinary shareholders meeting of Havas on Friday approved a deal under which Generale des Eaux will increase its stake in the group.</p>
<p>Generale will swap its 19.26 percent stake in Canal Plus and 100 percent of Generale d'Images for a 17.92 percent stake in Havas.</p>
<p>It will also buy Havas shares from Alcatel Alsthom, bringing its total stake to 30 percent.</p>
</text>
